Patch summary:
Honor gfxstream's existing VkWriteDescriptorSet descriptor-type filters in the
deep-copy generator. Vulkan permits inactive descriptor payload pointers to be
ignored, so dereferencing all non-null payloads can crash on undefined values.

The filter tables and streaming paths already distinguish image, buffer, and
texel-buffer descriptors. Reuse those tables for generated deep copies and
clear inactive destination pointers rather than carrying shallow-copied junk.
The goldfish_vk_deepcopy_guest.cpp hunk is the generator's output for the
deepcopy.py change, applied to upstream's checked-in file.

